WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,180
This time, I am rebelling against Tiangang.

2
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:18,340
Stop talking nonsense

3
00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:19,540
Take your time and eat it

4
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:20,700
To avoid long nights and too many dreams

5
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:26,200
Their team leader may come back at any time.

6
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:29,430
Do you want to take these eggs back?

7
00:00:29,430 --> 00:00:30,750
Isn’t that nonsense?

8
00:00:30,750 --> 00:00:32,470
If you follow me, you're afraid you won't have anything to eat.

9
00:00:32,470 --> 00:00:33,710
That's true

10
00:00:33,710 --> 00:00:34,830
Follow the boss

11
00:00:34,830 --> 00:00:37,110
Huo Se like me can have the strength of four bottles

12
00:00:37,110 --> 00:00:46,090
I just passed by here

13
00:00:46,090 --> 00:00:47,530
I saw two Tang wolves

14
00:00:47,530 --> 00:00:50,880
Did you read it wrong?

15
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:52,240
I saw it with my own eyes

16
00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:54,000
The two Tang wolves are very powerful

17
00:00:54,160 --> 00:00:55,320
Do you believe it or not?

18
00:00:55,320 --> 00:01:02,430
Could it be that I'm being targeted by Queen Tanglang?

19
00:01:02,430 --> 00:01:06,300
Move out of here team leader

20
00:01:06,300 --> 00:01:07,620
Our girls are all dead

21
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:08,900
Many eggs were also destroyed.

22
00:01:08,900 --> 00:01:10,620
Shouldn't such a great revenge be avenged?

23
00:01:10,620 --> 00:01:12,820
We also mapped out the territory of the Tanglang Clan

24
00:01:12,820 --> 00:01:15,260
Now she might be being targeted by Tang Lang Queen

25
00:01:15,260 --> 00:01:17,060
It’s hard to say whether he can survive or not.

26
00:01:17,060 --> 00:01:22,490
I want to take revenge on a bird, boss.

27
00:01:22,490 --> 00:01:24,730
Where to go to relax next?

28
00:01:24,730 --> 00:01:26,290
Officials go to school
